tyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
